## Tech Stack (Do Not Deviate)

```
Frontend:   Next.js 16 (App Router, Turbopack), TypeScript strict, Tailwind CSS 3
Animation:  Framer Motion (probability bars, number transitions, SSE streams)
State:      React Server Components + lightweight useState in clients
AI:         @anthropic-ai/sdk, claude-sonnet-4-5 (all LLM calls)
Blockchain: Circle App Kit + viem on Arc Testnet; server-derived wallets
Database:   Prisma + Postgres (in-memory fallback for dev)
Auth:       Email + OTP, signed-cookie sessions (custom, no NextAuth)
```

